{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "unitId": "chapter-curiosity-before-certainty-parts-part-4-hidden-structures-of-human-systems-chapter-11-the-structure-of-communication",
  "generationHash": "sha256:1bfa0c265fc74c0623edd2bb9e6f30760fccea6276372587c280412c3f52fdad",
  "granularity": "segment-only",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "text": "Chapter 11 — The Structure of Communication",
      "startMs": 0.0,
      "endMs": 3193.0,
      "charStart": 0,
      "charEnd": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "text": "It is easy to assume communication is about what was said.",
      "startMs": 3576.0,
      "endMs": 7024.0,
      "charStart": 45,
      "charEnd": 103
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "text": "In practice, it is often about what was heard, what was implied, and what was left unsaid.",
      "startMs": 7024.0,
      "endMs": 13085.0,
      "charStart": 103,
      "charEnd": 193
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "text": "Meaning travels through words, but also through timing, tone, context, and relationship.",
      "startMs": 13085.0,
      "endMs": 19505.0,
      "charStart": 193,
      "charEnd": 281
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "text": "You can see this in a simple team update.",
      "startMs": 20236.0,
      "endMs": 22640.0,
      "charStart": 285,
      "charEnd": 326
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "text": "Two people present the same facts.",
      "startMs": 22640.0,
      "endMs": 25136.0,
      "charStart": 326,
      "charEnd": 360
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "text": "One creates clarity; the other creates anxiety.",
      "startMs": 25461.0,
      "endMs": 29246.0,
      "charStart": 362,
      "charEnd": 409
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "text": "The difference is more than vocabulary.",
      "startMs": 29246.0,
      "endMs": 31870.0,
      "charStart": 409,
      "charEnd": 448
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "text": "It is signal quality in practice: what is emphasized, what is uncertain, what is named early, and what is hidden until late.",
      "startMs": 31870.0,
      "endMs": 39892.0,
      "charStart": 448,
      "charEnd": 572
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "text": "My first explanation for miscommunication used to be \"people are not paying attention.\" Sometimes that is true.",
      "startMs": 40473.0,
      "endMs": 48019.0,
      "charStart": 576,
      "charEnd": 687
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "text": "More often, the issue is that complex ideas get compressed too hard.",
      "startMs": 48019.0,
      "endMs": 52547.0,
      "charStart": 687,
      "charEnd": 755
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "text": "We shrink context to save time, then everyone fills in missing pieces differently.",
      "startMs": 52547.0,
      "endMs": 57957.0,
      "charStart": 755,
      "charEnd": 837
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "text": "Compression is useful and unavoidable.",
      "startMs": 58665.0,
      "endMs": 61243.0,
      "charStart": 841,
      "charEnd": 879
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "text": "We cannot explain everything every time.",
      "startMs": 61243.0,
      "endMs": 63878.0,
      "charStart": 879,
      "charEnd": 919
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "text": "The challenge is matching compression to stakes.",
      "startMs": 64250.0,
      "endMs": 67314.0,
      "charStart": 921,
      "charEnd": 969
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "text": "Low-stakes updates can be brief.",
      "startMs": 67314.0,
      "endMs": 70043.0,
      "charStart": 969,
      "charEnd": 1001
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "text": "High-stakes transitions usually need fuller context, including assumptions and tradeoffs.",
      "startMs": 70043.0,
      "endMs": 76428.0,
      "charStart": 1001,
      "charEnd": 1090
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "text": "Restraint matters too.",
      "startMs": 77322.0,
      "endMs": 78843.0,
      "charStart": 1094,
      "charEnd": 1116
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "text": "Good communicators avoid reacting to every signal at full volume.",
      "startMs": 78843.0,
      "endMs": 83522.0,
      "charStart": 1116,
      "charEnd": 1181
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "text": "They leave room for clarification before escalation.",
      "startMs": 83893.0,
      "endMs": 87168.0,
      "charStart": 1183,
      "charEnd": 1235
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "text": "They ask one more question before making one more accusation.",
      "startMs": 87168.0,
      "endMs": 91823.0,
      "charStart": 1235,
      "charEnd": 1296
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "text": "That pause often prevents unnecessary conflict.",
      "startMs": 91823.0,
      "endMs": 95701.0,
      "charStart": 1296,
      "charEnd": 1343
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "text": "Connection is the final layer.",
      "startMs": 96328.0,
      "endMs": 98406.0,
      "charStart": 1347,
      "charEnd": 1377
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "text": "People interpret messages through trust.",
      "startMs": 99103.0,
      "endMs": 101727.0,
      "charStart": 1378,
      "charEnd": 1418
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "text": "If they expect respect, ambiguity is often resolved generously.",
      "startMs": 101727.0,
      "endMs": 106777.0,
      "charStart": 1418,
      "charEnd": 1481
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "text": "If they expect threat, the same ambiguity is resolved defensively.",
      "startMs": 106777.0,
      "endMs": 111757.0,
      "charStart": 1481,
      "charEnd": 1547
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "text": "Communication quality, then, is partly a relationship outcome.",
      "startMs": 111757.0,
      "endMs": 116320.0,
      "charStart": 1547,
      "charEnd": 1609
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "text": "Curiosity helps across all of this.",
      "startMs": 117028.0,
      "endMs": 119420.0,
      "charStart": 1614,
      "charEnd": 1649
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "text": "It asks, \"What did they likely hear?\" \"What context am I assuming?\" \"What signal am I sending unintentionally?\" These questions reduce blame and make communication more precise.",
      "startMs": 119420.0,
      "endMs": 134455.0,
      "charStart": 1649,
      "charEnd": 1826
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "text": "When communication becomes more observable, groups become easier to navigate.",
      "startMs": 135000.0,
      "endMs": 139633.0,
      "charStart": 1829,
      "charEnd": 1906
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "text": "You see fewer conversations as fixed battles and more as systems that can be tuned.",
      "startMs": 139633.0,
      "endMs": 145833.0,
      "charStart": 1906,
      "charEnd": 1989
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "text": "That shift prepares us for the final step: living with curiosity in a world that stays uncertain.",
      "startMs": 145833.0,
      "endMs": 152996.0,
      "charStart": 1989,
      "charEnd": 2086
    }
  ]
}
